      "description": "<p>Kassebaum Baker became the first woman elected to the US Senate without following a spouse into office</p><p>Nancy Kassebaum Baker, a <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/kansas\">Kansas</a> governor’s daughter who became the first woman elected to the US Senate without following a spouse into office, has died. She was 94.</p><p>Kassebaum Baker died on Friday of natural causes, according to her son, Bill Kassebaum.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/22/nancy-kassebaum-baker-dies-aged-94\">Continue reading...</a>",
